{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月9日 11:24 星期一</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月9日 11:30 星期一</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>央視記者從山西省相關部門獲悉，山西太原市迎澤區柳巷街道豪生國際公寓火災已增至14人死亡。山西省太原市迎澤區柳巷街道豪生國際公寓周日（8日）下午4時59分發生火災，當局正調查起火原因。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>據當地官方通報，火警周日晚上7時救熄，搜救工作晚上8時30分結束，當時共38人送院救治，其中5人死亡，而到今早死亡人數增至14人。（中新社／央視）</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕太原 火災 公寓火災 山西 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.421492+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":240,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T03:24:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:02.470349+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.159717+00:00","content_hash":"d303374fced454019c67c4ef4dad3671d285d616b3323cdf14cfd7a963beabc0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}